            "zh-TW": "競爭對手以更高的薪水和更好的職位頭銜來誘惑她。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "The tempting offer was hard to refuse, but she decided to stay with her current employer.",
          "highlight": [
            "tempting"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "這個誘人的提議很難拒絕，但她決定留在現在的雇主身邊。"
          }
